{"Double interpolation causes duplicate ad-hoc filters in shard-split queries - runShardSplitQuery calls applyTemplateVariables, then splitQueriesByStreamShard passes already-interpolated queries to runSplitQuery which calls applyTemplateVariables again, causing ad-hoc filters to be injected twice into the query expression": 0.9085047841072083, "Need to interpolate in only one place - either remove interpolation from runSplitQuery and have callers pre-interpolate, or keep it only in runSplitQuery and remove it from runShardSplitQuery (recommended: keep interpolation only in runSplitQuery since it's the leaf function)": 0.9427886605262756}